  semantic_bridge:
    from: |
      Prior review detection:
        - preflight: checks /comments endpoint for bot comments
        - comment-scanner: fetches /comments for dedup
        - Problem: commit_id on comments shifts when new commits pushed
        - Result: old inline comments appear to belong to current HEAD
        - Consequence: false "already reviewed this commit" gate
    to: |
      Prior review detection:
        - preflight: checks /reviews endpoint for review events
        - Uses commit_id from review (frozen at submission time)
        - comment-scanner: uses original_commit_id on inline comments
        - Validates review body is substantive (length >= 20, not junk)
        - Result: accurate detection of which commit was reviewed
        - Consequence: no false gates, correct re-review trigger

